{"id": "1224e3d792b1bee42f541e41", "input": "JSTOR is a not-for-profit organization founded in 1995 to build trusted digital archives for scholarship. We work with the scholarly community to preserve their work and the materials they rely upon, and to build a common research platform that promotes the discovery and use of these resources.", "label": "general_reference", "metadata": {"dataset_version": "da5778152b614b8b6e77b1c6b0fb31dfc87c6f600e86280d0da6dbb52089ac26", "derivation": "external_llm_source_grounded", "fallback": false, "generated_at": "2026-10-26T14:44:16.799469+00:00", "grounding_score": 0.9512195121951219, "label_scores": {"geography": 0, "history": 0, "humanities": 0, "natural_science": 0, "social_science": 0, "technology_engineering": 0}, "origin": "validated_teacher_supervision", "prompt_version": "lantra-teacher-v3", "source_document_ids": ["00d6391300423c96c8d10028"], "source_grounded": true, "source_sha256": "3bd3c0e0495431c63cc5075b7110e6ada924206f993c1ceaacb78309e6ec4216", "source_title": null, "synthetic": true, "teacher_generated": true, "teacher_model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "teacher_provider": "gemini", "teacher_validated": true, "validation_method": "closed_set_label_v1", "validation_status": "accepted"}, "split": "train", "task": "classification"}
{"id": "4a34efa75e2d72bedeba1523", "input": "MY RELIGION. BY COUNT LEO TOLSTOI. _TRANSLATED FROM THE FRENCH._ NEW YORK: THOMAS Y. CROWELL & CO., 13 ASTOR PLACE. Copyright by THOMAS Y. CROWELL & CO., 1885.", "label": "humanities", "metadata": {"dataset_version": "da5778152b614b8b6e77b1c6b0fb31dfc87c6f600e86280d0da6dbb52089ac26", "derivation": "external_llm_source_grounded", "fallback": false, "generated_at": "2026-10-26T14:44:26.686380+00:00", "grounding_score": 0.9545454545454546, "label_scores": {"geography": 0, "history": 0, "humanities": 1, "natural_science": 0, "social_science": 0, "technology_engineering": 0}, "origin": "validated_teacher_supervision", "prompt_version": "lantra-teacher-v3", "source_document_ids": ["015146dde3d416388b908cc4"], "source_grounded": true, "source_sha256": "89e2eae193882336c68603e3ee80dc1374f9276e4d1e4a486e6b6ab2849554f4", "source_title": null, "synthetic": true, "teacher_generated": true, "teacher_model": "gpt-4.1-mini", "teacher_provider": "openai", "teacher_validated": true, "validation_method": "closed_set_label_v1", "validation_status": "accepted"}, "split": "train", "task": "classification"}
{"id": "d7fd0088f4f0ee23cbe8fbda", "input": "The regular standbyes had all taken their usual part, and for any one to speak or pray would have been about as irregular as for one of the regulars to fail in doing so. For the attendants at Newville prayer-meetings were strictly divided into the two classes of speakers and listeners, and, except during revivals or times of special interest, the distinction was scrupulously observed.", "label": "humanities", "metadata": {"dataset_version": "da5778152b614b8b6e77b1c6b0fb31dfc87c6f600e86280d0da6dbb52089ac26", "derivation": "external_llm_source_grounded", "fallback": false, "generated_at": "2026-10-26T14:44:29.479600+00:00", "grounding_score": 0.9811320754716981, "label_scores": {"geography": 0, "history": 0, "humanities": 1, "natural_science": 0, "social_science": 0, "technology_engineering": 0}, "origin": "validated_teacher_supervision", "prompt_version": "lantra-teacher-v3", "source_document_ids": ["01b37e2612a83d06cc63df20"], "source_grounded": true, "source_sha256": "44e4966422dbd2b35f4390ea4c7183362c975b034fb3e9dc56fcafffce1ed5df", "source_title": null, "synthetic": true, "teacher_generated": true, "teacher_model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "teacher_provider": "gemini", "teacher_validated": true, "validation_method": "closed_set_label_v1", "validation_status": "accepted"}, "split": "train", "task": "classification"}
{"id": "a0c763e16147ef8351f523e4", "input": "My Essay on Death[1] led me to make a conscientious enquiry into the present position of the great mystery, an enquiry which I have endeavoured to render as complete as possible. I had hoped that a single volume would be able to contain the result of these investigations, which, I may say at once, will teach nothing to those who have been over the same ground and which have nothing to recommend them except their sincerity, their impartiality and a certain scrupulous accuracy.", "label": "humanities", "metadata": {"dataset_version": "da5778152b614b8b6e77b1c6b0fb31dfc87c6f600e86280d0da6dbb52089ac26", "derivation": "external_llm_source_grounded", "fallback": false, "generated_at": "2026-10-26T14:45:02.719413+00:00", "grounding_score": 0.984375, "label_scores": {"geography": 0, "history": 0, "humanities": 1, "natural_science": 0, "social_science": 0, "technology_engineering": 0}, "origin": "validated_teacher_supervision", "prompt_version": "lantra-teacher-v3", "source_document_ids": ["01faef9e9c62cd1aaac9f2bc"], "source_grounded": true, "source_sha256": "de684a55b3f5ed9b712336c1c8b81b6ac387d498bd4d43c95f6889c9d41fe1c3", "source_title": null, "synthetic": true, "teacher_generated": true, "teacher_model": "gpt-4.1-mini", "teacher_provider": "openai", "teacher_validated": true, "validation_method": "closed_set_label_v1", "validation_status": "accepted"}, "split": "train", "task": "classification"}
{"id": "81473b08ac15a431b3dc7a8a", "input": "The Politics of Aristotle is the second part of a treatise of which the Ethics is the first part. It looks back to the Ethics as the Ethics looks forward to the Politics. For Aristotle did not separate, as we are inclined to do, the spheres of the statesman and the moralist.", "label": "humanities", "metadata": {"dataset_version": "da5778152b614b8b6e77b1c6b0fb31dfc87c6f600e86280d0da6dbb52089ac26", "derivation": "external_llm_source_grounded", "fallback": false, "generated_at": "2026-10-26T14:45:10.624512+00:00", "grounding_score": 0.967741935483871, "label_scores": {"geography": 0, "history": 1, "humanities": 2, "natural_science": 0, "social_science": 2, "technology_engineering": 0}, "origin": "validated_teacher_supervision", "prompt_version": "lantra-teacher-v3", "source_document_ids": ["0256a8ea24b2bd7b987f5199"], "source_grounded": true, "source_sha256": "5ad15516b99d3cbe7962a1c5718446f1a94ab09a09aef420c58929e446523fa1", "source_title": null, "synthetic": true, "teacher_generated": true, "teacher_model": "gpt-4.1-mini", "teacher_provider": "openai", "teacher_validated": true, "validation_method": "closed_set_label_v1", "validation_status": "accepted"}, "split": "train", "task": "classification"}
{"id": "3a754401fb6337861d3cc975", "input": "In writing the pages which follow this Preface, I have had to encounter the difficulty of compressing very extensive matter into an extremely limited space. As the subject was, in my eyes, a very interesting one, and every particular connected with it had often been food for thought and object of entertainment to myself, the task of curtailing was the more ungrateful: nor should I have undertaken it, had I not been convinced by my publisher that one volume would be as much as the public in general would be inclined to read.", "label": "humanities", "metadata": {"dataset_version": "da5778152b614b8b6e77b1c6b0fb31dfc87c6f600e86280d0da6dbb52089ac26", "derivation": "external_llm_source_grounded", "fallback": false, "generated_at": "2026-10-26T14:45:56.229920+00:00", "grounding_score": 0.9850746268656716, "label_scores": {"geography": 0, "history": 0, "humanities": 1, "natural_science": 0, "social_science": 0, "technology_engineering": 0}, "origin": "validated_teacher_supervision", "prompt_version": "lantra-teacher-v3", "source_document_ids": ["02dd03d41e763a1d34c830d6"], "source_grounded": true, "source_sha256": "310a94de7eb97bd359f2bb6c254236bbb457137c6863c6d694e6de7b2988d2b9", "source_title": null, "synthetic": true, "teacher_generated": true, "teacher_model": "gpt-4.1-mini", "teacher_provider": "openai", "teacher_validated": true, "validation_method": "closed_set_label_v1", "validation_status": "accepted"}, "split": "train", "task": "classification"}
